  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Earthquake '64 - EVOS Database",
  "description": "Data Type: Ocean/Coasts ; The dataset depicts the contours of geomorphic displacement measured in feet from the 1964 Earthquake at a 1:2,000,000 scale. Displacement ranges from approximately -8 feet to 35 feet near Montague Island. This data layer was intended as a resource for use in the damage assessment and restoration efforts of the EVOS geoprocessing group.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
